{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "others_tuto_release_befo_jp.gtx", "item_key": "others_tuto_release_befo_1003_president", "source_sha256": "8aea12526c2dce9e7fed6dc41b793fae9b73e932e871184869814327996d3289", "ja": "ウォッホン！　よく来てくれた。\n私がこのプロダクションの社長、高木順二朗だ。", "zh": "咳咳！欢迎你来。\n我是这家艺能事务所的社长，高木顺二朗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "others_tuto_release_befo_jp.gtx", "item_key": "others_tuto_release_befo_1004_president", "source_sha256": "550cb627c7b722121abd3548957d4e56628291b2cde766e53ed4319c61d04c0b", "ja": "君の仕事は、わが社に所属するアイドル達を\nプロデュースすること。", "zh": "你的工作，\n就是要培育我们公司的偶像们，", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "others_tuto_release_befo_jp.gtx", "item_key": "others_tuto_release_befo_1005_president", "source_sha256": "bf28f5e15f053ce669411ff4042c8c49500b8f13b8e41fa479cedcb562c7459f", "ja": "そして、彼女達の魅力を最高に引き出すことだ。\n道は険しいと思うが、頑張ってくれたまえ！", "zh": "并且让她们展现出最大的魅力。\n虽然这不是件容易的事，但还请你好好加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "others_tuto_release_befo_jp.gtx", "item_key": "others_tuto_release_befo_1006_president", "source_sha256": "99f90dfffdaae4fc2836877a1b88418f33e65ee8ec8963dfd386e85bfefc0ad3", "ja": "……と、君に挨拶したのは、いつの事だったかな。\n月日が経つのは早いものだ。", "zh": "……我用这席话欢迎你加入已经是多久前的事了？\n时间过得可真快啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "others_tuto_release_befo_jp.gtx", "item_key": "others_tuto_release_befo_1007_president", "source_sha256": "f9b632be61f82aeea6dac147b699f5482649eb13c2cf93acbda5c1d3e686edc7", "ja": "気がつけば、天海君達13人のアイドル諸君も、\n世間に認められつつある。いや、結構結構！", "zh": "回过神来，天海她们13位偶像也已经\n渐渐受到世人认可了。嗯，不错不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "others_tuto_release_befo_jp.gtx", "item_key": "others_tuto_release_befo_1008_p", "source_sha256": "422474972792f66b9678fe61cfc5713c278b52b7e7e0131d90b42fa7e4dc2ef2", "ja": "そうですね。それで社長、\n今日は俺に、何か大事な話があるとか……？", "zh": "就是说啊。倒是社长，\n听社长说今天有件重要的事要告诉我，是什么事呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "others_tuto_release_befo_jp.gtx", "item_key": "others_tuto_release_befo_1009_president", "source_sha256": "157e01a4a18fc76cbc5e71fcb0684832e40bcc9586b4bd155860ca80baea0ddf", "ja": "うむ。そのことだが……。", "zh": "嗯，关于那件事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "others_tuto_release_befo_jp.gtx", "item_key": "others_tuto_release_befo_1010_president", "source_sha256": "0f35d547055a75ad266778c185c52437f350e159c5d0b609c8976c695749af0a", "ja": "実は君に、新たなプロジェクトを\n担当してもらおうと思っているのだよ。", "zh": "其实，\n我想让你来负责新的专案。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
