{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "others_tuto_release_befo_jp.gtx", "item_key": "others_tuto_release_befo_1018_president", "source_sha256": "9f4dbf4f9a538469db7214931c85791b48eb5971fcfe0b4ffad0f0cf32dce422", "ja": "では、改めて説明させてもらおう。\n新しいプロジェクト、その名も……。", "zh": "那我继续说明下去。\n新的专案名称也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
