{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "others_tuto_release_befo_jp.gtx", "item_key": "others_tuto_release_befo_1023_president", "source_sha256": "33410bebce37d6a2bba1aa0f670650a85e4736edec8717fcea93a3b89ed03fe7", "ja": "名は体を表すというだろう？\nつまり、このプロジェクトは……。", "zh": "不是有句话叫「名副其实」吗？\n也就是说，这个专案……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "others_tuto_release_befo_jp.gtx", "item_key": "others_tuto_release_befo_1024_president", "source_sha256": "1ef8a690e56f6d9e2c34bdb20625fa553bb29a09146f81fa1c1aea0b8f5d631d", "ja": "39人の新人アイドルを集め、拠点となる劇場を作り、\nそこで日夜公演を行って全員を売り出していく！", "zh": "将招募39名新人偶像，并打造一座作为据点的剧场，\n在那里不分日夜举行公演，捧红所有成员！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "others_tuto_release_befo_jp.gtx", "item_key": "others_tuto_release_befo_1025_president", "source_sha256": "246d2734764ad8913ef61e46a5e34bff6a0f58f9bf02d7fde62ad762d6b5de3e", "ja": "という、壮大な計画なのだよ！", "zh": "就是这么大型的计划喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "others_tuto_release_befo_jp.gtx", "item_key": "others_tuto_release_befo_1026_p", "source_sha256": "dcb0a80070014d1e40c00e6f33118d70797c2ccef556e50d17065e870c64bbdf", "ja": "さ、39人！？\nしかも、専用の劇場まで！？", "zh": "3、39名！？\n而且还要打造专用剧场！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "others_tuto_release_befo_jp.gtx", "item_key": "others_tuto_release_befo_1027_president", "source_sha256": "3bbbdb12f164ebf375c88608ef010db6f19306e2953990ff95122b220c4247bc", "ja": "そうだ。そして君には、39人の新人アイドルと、\n劇場の運営を担ってもらいたいと思っている！", "zh": "没错。我打算让你培育39名新人偶像，\n并负责剧场的营运工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "others_tuto_release_befo_jp.gtx", "item_key": "others_tuto_release_befo_1028_president", "source_sha256": "9c1a349348e987749301836b1fc3415392fa09a83e90f3d56087d9f311268373", "ja": "劇場での公演には、すでに人気が出始めている天海君達\n13人にも加わってもらい、盛り上げていくつもりだ。", "zh": "关于剧场公演，我也打算让已经颇有人气的\n天海她们13个人加入，炒热整座剧场的气氛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "others_tuto_release_befo_jp.gtx", "item_key": "others_tuto_release_befo_1029_president", "source_sha256": "a8884732faf75acf776f7627706253e270d6324c183f1c20311b8cf40d94db89", "ja": "どうだろう。引き受けてくれるかね？", "zh": "如何？你愿意接下这个任务吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "others_tuto_release_befo_jp.gtx", "item_key": "others_tuto_release_befo_1030", "source_sha256": "f9384068d8ef64586e102b8690994e23fd8037369edae78b507385c459bf2789", "ja": "……はい！", "zh": "……好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "others_tuto_release_befo_jp.gtx", "item_key": "others_tuto_release_befo_2000_p", "source_sha256": "801570c6784511142db30cf0a85ce27b689e2a1cde2cac0b109f9b91e348d75c", "ja": "……はい！　責任はとてつもなく大きいと思います。\nでも、だからこそ、やりがいがあります！", "zh": "……我愿意！我想这无疑是相当重大的责任，\n但也正因如此，很值得挑战！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "others_tuto_release_befo_jp.gtx", "item_key": "others_tuto_release_befo_2001_president", "source_sha256": "9d141614a1fe608b30e620c6eade4d7aae49d83f5a93bc183fa73cf70bc9dcc7", "ja": "うむ！　君ならそう言ってくれると思っていたよ。\nさすが、かつて私がピンと来た男だ！", "zh": "嗯！我就知道你会这么说。\n真不愧是我当初一眼看上的人才！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "others_tuto_release_befo_jp.gtx", "item_key": "others_tuto_release_befo_2002_president", "source_sha256": "8691aced843ca170f28bd1de9d2299aa03262a593147ca485b031095dd0c1358", "ja": "さて、劇場を運営していく以上、\n劇場専用のスタッフも当然必要になる。", "zh": "那么，既然要经营剧场，\n当然也需要剧场专用的工作人员。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "others_tuto_release_befo_jp.gtx", "item_key": "others_tuto_release_befo_2003_president", "source_sha256": "989afaea9a9bc895a7a9d19eecd5dbd24dc627c3930f56bf9fc61d95995a20da", "ja": "そこで青羽君の出番、というわけだ。青羽君、劇場の\n運営を、しっかりサポートしてあげてくれたまえ。", "zh": "这时就轮到青羽出场了。\n青羽，请你好好协助他经营剧场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
